,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116508","id":3937779700,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qtb_0","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-21T00:35:45Z","updated_at":"2026-02-21T00:48:33Z","body":"> A more concrete thing this issue prevents is making a modified version of `StyleBoxTexture` since a user either gets to define the min size based on texture margins or allow the grabber to cover the background, but not both.\n\nIs adjusting the `region`/`margin` of an image using `AtlasTexture` (or the `region_rect` and `content_margin_*` in `StyleBoxTexture`) not meeting your needs?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3937779700/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3938183090","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116508#issuecomment-3938183090","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116508","id":3938183090,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qu-ey","user":{"login":"kevinlam508","id":14243263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjQzMjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14243263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinlam508","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-21T05:05:29Z","updated_at":"2026-02-21T05:17:29Z","body":"> > A more concrete thing this issue prevents is making a modified version of `StyleBoxTexture` since a user either gets to define the min size based on texture margins or allow the grabber to cover the background, but not both.\n> \n> Is adjusting the `region`/`margin` of an image using `AtlasTexture` (or the `region_rect` and `content_margin_*` in `StyleBoxTexture`) not meeting your needs?\n\nUnfortunately not, but I do feel like that's more of my unusual situation where I am scaling textures in the UI. There are definitely better ways to set up the images so that the scaling wouldn't be needed, but I am not in that situation. I do wish what you brought up worked because I didn't set up the region rect editor for my custom type for brevity.\n\nEven though my use is strange, I think another person making `StyleBox` types would also hit this issue. The `StyleBox` docs say min size is used for drawing for the box itself while content margins are for spacing other aspects of the UI in relation to the box, so it's odd that the \"grabber content\" is being affected by the min size.\nEdit: I've now also realized `PanelContainer` does the same min size vs content margin mixup, but that it a separate issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3938183090/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3938778573","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116508#issuecomment-3938778573","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116508","id":3938778573,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qxP3N","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-21T13:27:38Z","updated_at":"2026-02-21T13:27:38Z","body":"It sounds 